    <div ><h1>Public Records Office</h1></div>    
</div><div><hr /></div>
<div >
    <div ><p>The Office of Insurance Regulation strives to make as many of the records, data, reports and other documents filed with or produced by OIR available on its website.</p><p>Please see the categories below for frequently requested information:</p><ul><li><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" href="https://www.floir.com/property-casualty/take-out-companies">Citizens' Take-Out Company Information</a></li><li><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" href="https://www.floir.com/life-health/federal-health-insurance">Federal Health Care Insurance</a></li><li><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" href="https://irfssearch.fldfs.com/">Form (Policy) or Rate Filings Made by Insurance Companies</a></li><li><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" href="https://www.floir.com/companysearch/">General Insurance Company Information</a></li><li><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" href="https://www.floir.com/office/memoranda/index.aspx">Informational Memoranda</a></li><li><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" href="https://www.floir.com/Sections/PandC/ProfLiab_db/index.aspx">Malpractice Closed Claims</a>&nbsp;- Medical, Professional Liability, etc.</li><li><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" target="_blank" href="https://apps.fldfs.com/mcws/default.aspx">Medicare Supplement Rates</a></li><li><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" href="https://www.floir.com/resources-and-reports/annual-report">OIR Annual Reports</a></li><li><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" href="https://www.floir.com/tools-and-data/residential-market-share-reports">Personal and Commercial Residential Policy Data (QUASR)</a></li><li><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" href="https://www.floir.com/Sections/MarketInvestigations/is_market_inv_index.aspx">Regulatory Actions</a></li><li><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" href="https://www.floir.com/resources-and-reports/industry-reports">Report, Data Call, and Other OIR Published Documents</a></li><li><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" href="https://choices.fldfs.com/landh/SmallGroup?_ga=2.226794781.1232091983.1516724573-956168712.1516724573">Small Employer Major Medical Insurance Rates</a></li></ul><p>The following categories are linked to websites outside the OIR:</p><ul><li><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" target="_blank" href="https://licenseesearch.fldfs.com/">Insurance Agent (Producer/Adjuster) or Agency Information</a>&nbsp;- Department of Financial Services</li><li><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" target="_blank" href="https://content.naic.org/publications">Financial Statements</a>&nbsp;- National Association of Insurance Commissioners (NAIC)</li><li><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" target="_blank" href="https://www.fltreasurehunt.gov/">FLTreasureHunt.gov</a>&nbsp;&ndash; Search for Unclaimed Property (which can include life insurance proceeds)</li></ul><p>To request a public record or a legal order issued by OIR, please contact the Public Records Office.&nbsp;<em>Note: OIR does not collect/have individual insurance policies issued by companies to individual policyholders.</em></p></div>    
</div>
